  "description": "The `trax` dotnet tool. `trax generate` scaffolds a Trax .NET hub project and a trains library (trains, junctions, input/output records) from a GraphQL SDL or OpenAPI schema; `trax machine new|generate|check` scaffolds a state machine and generates its IR, TypeScript twin and differential corpus from a compiled assembly. Install it with `dotnet tool install Trax.Cli`.",
